  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다. </span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요. </span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/994461435CC8F14C07\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"518\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"제목 없음.png\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"518\"  id=\"A_994461435CC8F14C07593B\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9914E04A5CC8F28C07\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"187\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"제목 없음1.png\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"187\"  id=\"A_9914E04A5CC8F28C077093\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">정답은 이것인데요, (가)와 (나)에 계수를 붙인 학생들이 꽤 있어서 채점에 혼란이네요ㅠ</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">(가)는&nbsp; </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -1.5pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">H</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -1.5pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt; vertical-align: sub; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">2&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (나)는</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -1.5pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">2H</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -1.5pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt; vertical-align: sub; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">2</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -1.5pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">O</span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"1\" style=\"line-height: 130%; text-indent: 3.4pt; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 97%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 97%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조;\"><br></span><!--[if gte vml 1]><v:shapetype id=\"_x0000_t75\"  coordsize=\"21600,21600\" o:spt=\"75\" o:preferrelative=\"t\" path=\"m@4@5l@4@11@9@11@9@5xe\"  filled=\"f\" stroked=\"f\">\t\t<v:stroke joinstyle=\"miter\"/>\t\t<v:formulas>\t\t<v:f eqn=\"if lineDrawn pixelLineWidth 0\"/>\t\t<v:f eqn=\"sum @0 1 0\"/>\t\t<v:f eqn=\"sum 0 0 @1\"/>\t\t<v:f eqn=\"prod @2 1 2\"/>\t\t<v:f eqn=\"prod @3 21600 pixelWidth\"/>\t\t<v:f eqn=\"prod @3 21600 pixelHeight\"/>\t\t<v:f eqn=\"sum @0 0 1\"/>\t\t<v:f eqn=\"prod @6 1 2\"/>\t\t<v:f eqn=\"prod @7 21600 pixelWidth\"/>\t\t<v:f eqn=\"sum @8 21600 0\"/>\t\t<v:f eqn=\"prod @7 21600 pixelHeight\"/>\t\t<v:f eqn=\"sum @10 21600 0\"/>\t\t</v:formulas>\t\t<v:path o:extrusionok=\"f\" gradientshapeok=\"t\" o:connecttype=\"rect\"/>\t\t<o:lock v:ext=\"edit